            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Usually unremarkable. 50–200 mg PO q8–12h; cats, 50 mg PO",
              "pdf_page": 1262,
              "printed_page": 1180,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Inflammatory or stress leukogram may be q12–24h) or lactulose (10 g/15 mL solution present. or syrup, 1 mL/4.5 kg q8–12h to effect); continue for 2–3 weeks after removal of the",
              "pdf_page": 1262,
              "printed_page": 1180,
              "column": 2
            }
          ]
        },
